      "writtenOn": "2020-08-04T06:06:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The key sections of spec are below.\nPlease note REJECT in P2.0 becomes NOT_SUPPORTED in PD3.0.\n\nNote L5458 works because we\u0027re \"usb_pe_\u003e\u003edrp\u003c\u003c_sm.c\" and have a SRC_CAP.\nOther SM may not have support SRC_CAP, and should respond differently.\nR/NS response gated on version; but not applicable to DRP SM here.\n\nN  \u003d Normative.\nRJ \u003d Reject\nNS \u003d *PD3 Not_Supported\nNA \u003d Not Allowed\n\nPD2.0 R1.3 \nTable 8-39 Policy Engine States\nPE_DR_SNK_Give_Source_Cap\nTable 6-39 Applicability of Control Messages\n                  Source  Sink  DRP\nReceived Message\nGet_Source_Cap        N   RJ    N\nTransmitted Message\nSource_Capabilities   N   NA    N\n\nPD3.0 R2.0\nTable 8-71 Policy Engine States\nPE_DR_SNK_Give_Source_Cap\nTable 6-69 Applicability of Control Messages\n                 Source  Sink  DRP\nReceived Message\nGet_Source_Cap       N   NS    N\nTransmitted Message\nSource_Capabilities  N   NA    N",
      "parentUuid": "4b288c02_6c88164a",
      "revId": "996f8ea21ad17dec452df9492c263428cc437a54",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
